<BaseLayout title="Submit" description="Help Run PSL correct or add local running information."><header class="page-head"><div class="shell"><p class="eyebrow">Keep the guide accurate</p><h1>Submit</h1><p>Suggest an event, group run, route, resource, or correction.</p><span class="verified">Last verified July 15, 2026</span></div></header><section class="prose shell"><div class="notice"><strong>Submission channel pending:</strong> the public form will be connected after the destination inbox and privacy terms are approved.</div><h2>What to include</h2><ul><li>Name and category</li><li>Public organizer or municipal source URL</li><li>Date, time, or schedule when applicable</li><li>The correction you are requesting</li></ul><p>Run PSL reviews submissions before publishing. Submission does not guarantee inclusion.</p></section></BaseLayout>
